OL,3,ACanada poaches dozens of top US
OL,4,Aresearchers for its universities
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanada is hiring dozens of researchers
OL,7,Faway from US universities, including
OL,8,Ftop research institutions such as
OL,9,FHarvard as its relationship with its
OL,10,Fneighbour continues to sour.
OL,12,FMore than three-fourths of the 64
OL,13,Fprofessors who are moving to Canada
OL,14,Ffrom around the world will come from
OL,15,Fthe US. Under a new government
OL,16,Fprogramme, they'll receive funding from
OL,17,Fa pool of C$504m ($362m; #268m) for
OL,18,Fresearch in fields such as climate
OL,19,Fchange and medicine.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
