OL,3,ACanada poaches dozens of top US
OL,4,Aresearchers for its universities
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump's
OL,7,Fadministration has accused universities
OL,8,Fof being dominated by left-wing
OL,9,Fideology and diversity policies, and of
OL,10,Ffailing to tackle alleged campus
OL,11,Fantisemitism.
OL,13,FThe BBC contacted the White House and
OL,14,FUS Department of Education.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
